eartag: eartag (Edit audio file tags)
eartag:
eartag: Ear Tag is a simple audio file tag editor. It is primarily geared 
eartag: towards making quick edits or bulk-editing tracks in albums/EPs. 
eartag: Unlike other tagging programs, Ear Tag does not require the user to 
eartag: set up a music library folder. It can:
eartag: Edit tags of MP3, WAV, M4A, FLAC, OGG and WMA files. Modify metadata 
eartag: of multiple files at once. Rename files using information from 
eartag: present tags. Identify files using AcoustID. Network access is only 
eartag: used for the "Identify selected files" option.        
eartag: Source: https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/eartag
